te the sentence. </span><span class=\"bullet\"> Use capital letters where necessary.\n"}], "type": "post_instructions"}, {"type": "template_override", "content": 2}]}, {"template_override": 1, "stimuli_ids": [], "questions": [{"responses": [{"correct": 0, "_data": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}], "id": 0, "selected": 0}, {"correct": 1, "_data": [{"type": "text", "content": "have got to"}], "id": 1, "selected": 0}], "id": 0, "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le13ob09re6aud04"}, {"type": "text", "content": "In my opinion, parents"}], "type": "question"}, {"contents": {"type": "", "content": "maintain balance between their work and family lives. "}, "type": "post_question"}, {"type": "objective", "content": "secondary_8"}]}, {"responses": [{"correct": 0, "_data": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}], "id": 0, "selected": 0}, {"correct": 1, "_data": [{"type": "text", "content": "going to have to"}], "id": 1, "selected": 0}], "id": 1, "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le13ob09re6aud05"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Children are"}], "type": "question"}, {"contents": {"type": "", "content": "understand that their parents need to work to make a living."}, "type": "post_question"}, {"type": "objective", "content": "secondary_8"}]}], "type": "TYP", "id": 10, "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": " Frank gives his opinion on what some people need to do in the future."}], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"type": "group_name", "content": "Quiz"}], "type": "group"}, {"type": "feedback", "content": {"attempt_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}, {"type": "text", "content": ""}], "correct_feedback": "Correct!", "allowed_attempts": 2, "incorrect_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "Whoops! Something important is missing."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Maybe next time..."}]}}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Instructions: <span class=\"bullet\">Listen to the audio.</span> <span class=\"bullet\">Type in the missing words. </span><span class=\"bullet\">Use capital letters where necessary.</span> "}], "type": "post_instructions"}]}, {"template_override": 1, "stimuli_ids": [], "questions": [{"responses": [{"correct": 0, "_data": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}], "id": 0, "selected": 0}, {"correct": 1, "_data": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}], "id": 1, "selected": 0}], "id": 0, "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}], "type": "question"}]}], "type": "RSLT", "id": 11, "_data": [{"contents": [], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"type": "group_name", "content": "Quiz"}], "type": "group"}, {"type": "feedback", "content": {"attempt_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}, {"type": "text", "content": ""}], "correct_feedback": "Correct!", "allowed_attempts": 2, "incorrect_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "Whoops! Something important is missing."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Maybe next time..."}]}}]}], "type": "scholar", "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "has_nav", "content": true}, {"type": "has_exercise_controls", "content": true}], "type": "lab_options"}], "id": 0, "stimuli": [{"type": "welcome", "template_override": 1, "_data": [], "id": 0, "contents": [{}]}, {"contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"coverimg": "engenn6le13ob09re2img01.jpg", "audiosrc": "engenn6le13ob09re2aud01", "images": [{"time": "0", "image": "engenn6le13ob09re2img01.jpg", "id": 0, "text": ""}, {"time": "100", "image": "engenn6le13ob09re2img01.jpg", "id": 1, "text": "In the past decade, families in many countries have changed profoundly. People have got to struggle endlessly in order to balance their work and family lives."}, {"time": "9100", "image": "engenn6le13ob09re2img02.jpg", "id": 2, "text": "\"American families today are living under circumstances much different than even a few years ago. Every income group and geographic region is affected,\" recently argued Representative George Miller, former chairman of the House Select Committee on Children, Youth and Families. More than half of the US children under 13 live in a household where both parents work, or where the only parent works."}, {"time": "31500", "image": "engenn6le13ob09re2img03.jpg", "id": 3, "text": "Parents choose to work for different reasons. Challenging career opportunities have emerged. But, more importantly, in many families, both parents have got to be gainfully employed in order to make a living. Mothers of infants and toddlers are more likely to return to work after a leave of absence than before. It is also more common to see grandparents raising their grandchildren. Personally, I think all family members are going to have to be flexible to adapt to change."}]}}], "template_override": 1, "title": "", "type": "audio", "id": 1, "_data": []}]}], "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "Gender Issues"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "Changing Family Dynamics"}, {"type": "position", "content": 9}, {"type": "origin", "content": "stub"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 13}, {"type": "level", "content": "B1.1"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": "Describe  routines and regular activities in a wider range of social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations"}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations"}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations"}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations"}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations"}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations"}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations"}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations"}], "type": "objectives"}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn6le13ob09re1img01.jpg"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Adverbs of Manner"}, {"type": "describer", "content": " You use adverbs of manner to describe how something is done. <br>Example: She walked slowly. <br> How did she walk? Slowly."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Many adverbs are formed by adding -ly to an adjective: ><br>Examples: sad--->sadly, curious--->curiously"}, {"type": "text", "content": "You take out the letter -y and add <span class=\"strong\">-ily</span> to adjectives ending in -y. <br>Example: angry--->angrily"}, {"type": "text", "content": "The adjectives <span class=\"strong\">fast</span>, <span class=\"strong\">hard</span>, <span class=\"strong\">well</span> and <span class=\"strong\">straight</span> are exceptions.  They do not change when they become adverbs."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":6,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Adjective\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Adverb\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"gainful\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"gainfully\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"profound\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"profoundly\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"endless\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"endlessly\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"careful\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"carefully\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"regular\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"regularly\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}"}, {"type": "example", "content": "In the past decade, family structures in many countries have changed profoundly. "}, {"type": "example", "content": "Most adults have to be gainfully employed in order to make a living. "}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Expressing What is Necessary"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "You can use certain expressions to talk about what is necessary to do in the future in order for something to happen."}, {"type": "text", "content": "You have to... <ul><li>You have got to\u2026 </li><li>I'm going to have to\u2026 </li><li>You need to\u2026</li>"}, {"type": "example", "content": "More and more people have to struggle endlessly in order to balance their work and family lives.   "}, {"type": "example", "content": "Most adults have to be gainfully employed in order to make a living. "}, {"type": "example", "content": "All of these members of the family are going to have be flexible to adapt to change."}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to make a living "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to earn a sufficient amount of money to pay all your bills "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Most adults have to be employed in order to make a living. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le13ob09aud01"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you use when you talk about families."}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "infant "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "baby "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Mothers of infants are more likely to return to work after a leave than before."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le13ob09aud02"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "toddler"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a young child "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Toddlers require a lot of attention and care."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le13ob09aud03"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "leave of absence"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "temporary period of time not working "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Women usually take a leave of absence when they have children."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le13ob09aud04"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to be employed"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to have a job "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: In many families, both parents have to be gainfully employed in order to make a living. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le13ob09aud05"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "gainfully "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "profitably (for making money) "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adverb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Adults have to be gainfully employed so they can pay all their bills."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le13ob09aud06"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "profoundly "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a lot; considerably; to a great extent "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adverb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: In the past decade, families in many countries have changed profoundly. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le13ob09aud07"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "endlessly"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "with no end "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adverb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: People have to struggle endlessly in order to balance their work and family lives.   "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le13ob09aud08"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "recently "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "in the recent past; a short time ago "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adverb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: The President recently stated that every income group is affected."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le13ob09aud09"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Read the situations in the box."}, {"type": "text", "content": "With a partner, discuss the situation. Try to find a solution for the situation."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Write down the solution."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Role-play a meeting. You inform the employee about what solutions are possible. "}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":1,\"columns\":1,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Situations:<br/>1.  A mother has a toddler at home. The grandmother can stay with the child, but only in the afternoon. <br/>2. A father has an infant daughter. He is a single parent (there is only one parent). <br/>3. It is the first day of school for a young child. Both parents want to be there. Both parents work at your company.\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border\"}"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I discuss situations."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I write solutions."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I prepare a role-play with a partner."}]}]}